#### Job description

**Job description**

If you are looking for a career opportunity in an innovative, market-leading company that respects the individual values of its employees, Serasa Experian is the right place.

We are looking for professionals to work in our Professional Service area, where they will have contact with our differentiated technologies and methodologies and with great challenges and career growth opportunities.

The Professional Service team is focused on delivering projects for Fraud and Risk solutions (Document verification, Biometrics, SDKs, APIs), and the professional must have these skills to be part of this PS Team.

In the implementation projects of these platforms, the solutions are adapted to the needs of clients through the necessary parameterizations and customizations of technical and functional aspects with different levels of complexity.

The mission of this professional will be to work with project implementation teams at clients, in a high-performance environment, producing high-quality results and delivering within the established deadlines.

What will your main deliverables be?

- Work in multidisciplinary teams throughout the entire project lifecycle (from requirements analysis to testing/certification, deployment, and support);


- Gather business, technical, and functional requirements to meet client needs with the implementation of projects;


- Act in a consultative manner in configuring business rules, as requested by the sales teams according to project proposals;


- Monitor the deployment of the platforms;


- Document and design the solution with quality;


- Serve our clients with a level of quality that will surprise them.


- Speed up deliveries by using reusable components in implementation;


- Ensure that requirements have been implemented in accordance with client needs, assisting with unit testing;


- Provide precise updates on progress against the work plan.


What will your day-to-day be like?

- Energetic and dynamic, with many interactions with clients and our internal teams;


- Always seeking improvements in how we deliver our products and services.


#### Qualifications

**Qualifications**

- Proactivity, responsibility, and commitment to delivery quality;
- An 'owner' attitude;
- Empathy with clients and teamwork;
- Brings innovative ideas that make us "think differently";
- Knowledge/experience with the lifecycle of a technology solution implementation project;
- Responds quickly to changes, with focus and simplicity in executing their work;

