#### Company Description

Experian is a global data and technology company that empowers people and businesses around the world to create opportunities. We operate in a variety of markets, such as financial services, healthcare, automotive, agribusiness, insurance, among others. Experian invests in people and in new advanced technologies to unlock the power of data. We have an amazing team of 25,200 employees in 32 countries.

Our uniqueness is valuing yours. Experian's culture, which is people-centered, inclusive and purpose-driven, is recognized by various awards, including World's Best Workplaces™ 2025 (Fortune Global Top 25) and Great Place To Work™ in 26 countries, among others. Check out Experian Life on social media or explore our careers site to understand why. Experian also takes pride in being an employer that promotes equal opportunity and affirmative action.

#### Job Description

We are looking for a person to join the Serasa Crédito Acquisition CRM team, with the mission of developing communication strategies and journeys that enhance the acquisition, activation and conversion of our consumers. This position will play an important role in the evolution of our CRM strategy, using Salesforce Marketing Cloud (SFMC) to build automated journeys, segmentations and campaigns driven by data and behavior.

We are looking for someone with an analytical profile, business vision and the ability to connect data, technology, communication and experimentation to generate measurable impact on Serasa Crédito's results.

Main responsibilities

- Plan, build and optimize acquisition and conversion campaigns and journeys within Salesforce Marketing Cloud;
- Develop automated journeys using Journey Builder, considering consumer behavior, moment and stage in the funnel;
- Create and evolve audience segmentations using Data Extensions, filters, queries and SQL;
- Structure automations and CRM routines through Automation Studio;
- Plan and operationalize communications across channels such as email, push, SMS and other channels integrated into the CRM ecosystem;
- Identify opportunities to increase conversion along the Serasa Crédito funnel, turning data and insights into new journeys and campaigns;
- Develop personalization strategies, ensuring greater relevance of messages, offers and contact moments;
