We are looking for a Market Research Specialist with a highly analytical profile to play a key role in leading and developing strategic market research projects. If you are passionate about turning complex data into actionable _insights_ and have solid experience guiding decision-making in a high-performance corporate environment, this position is for you. You will work end to end, connecting research methodologies with business strategy and directly influencing multiple stakeholders.

#### Qualifications

